    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Hindarin tiga dash skill 1 Fatih, tahap ketiga kasih knock-up. 2) Abis ult aktif, lifesteal dan tenacity-nya kuat banget. Jangan adu langsung atau nyoba nge-control dia."
    },
